  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-letter\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #faf7ef; box-sizing: border-box; color: #32463d; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 28px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto 28px; max-width: 100%; text-align: center; width: 68%\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; text-align: center\"><h1 style=\"color: inherit; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-align: center; text-indent: 0\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1></section></section><p style=\"color: #32463d; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: center\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px dotted #88505b; color: #32463d; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 12px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: center; text-indent: 0\">留一点时间给自己</h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\">从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote style=\"color: #32463d; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: center\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px dotted #88505b; color: #32463d; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 12px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: center; text-indent: 0\">让行动变得简单</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 22px\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">留意自己的真实感受</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #88505b; border: 1px solid #dac8c6; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">时段</th><th style=\"background-color: #88505b; border: 1px solid #dac8c6; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dac8c6; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">早晨</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dac8c6; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dac8c6; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">傍晚</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dac8c6; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color: #32463d; line-height: 1.8; margin: 28px 0 0; text-align: center\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section>"
